      `[BatchCoordinator] §FIX-NESTED-BATCH-DROPS-GUARDS ${mode} — re-entrant runBatch folded into the live batch (C16 §8.7). levels ${before.levels}→${this._pendingLevelIds.size}, elements ${before.elements}→${this._totalElementCount}, skipRedetectRooms=${this._skipRedetectRooms} skipPbrUpgrade=${this._skipPbrUpgrade} syncDepth=${this._syncDepth}`
